ough customer or user platforms, online forms, WhatsApp journeys, loyalty programmes, service portals or other digital channels where relevant.","controlObjective":"Assess fraud risk arising through customer and user digital channels where the organisation operates them.","weight":1,"isCritical":false,"isHardGate":false,"sortOrder":14,"applicabilityCondition":{"any":[{"questionId":"G08","in":["yes","platform","unknown"]},{"questionId":"G09","in":["yes","unknown"]},{"questionId":"G13","in":["yes","unknown"]}]},"redirectWhen":null,"skipReasonCode":"gateway_no_digital_footprint","evidenceReference":"G28-D2-Q08"},{"questionId":"D3-Q01","questionCode":"D3-Q01","domainCode":"D3","prompt":"High-risk processes have segregation of duties between initiation, approval, processing and reconciliation.","controlObjective":"Ensure no single person can initiate, approve, process and reconcile the same high-risk transaction.","weight":1.5,"isCritical":true,"isHardGate":true,"sortOrder":15,"applicabilityCondition":null,"redirectWhen":null,"skipReasonCode":null,"evidenceReference":"G28-D3-Q01"},{"questionId":"D3-Q02","questionCode":"D3-Q02","domainCode":"D3","prompt":"Transactions or operational activities above defined risk or value thresholds require independent review or approval.","controlObjective":"Require genuinely independent review or approval for transactions and activities above defined risk or value thresholds.","weight":1.25,"isCritical":false,"isHardGate":false,"sortOrder":16,"applicabilityCondition":null,"redirectWhen":null,"skipReasonCode":null,"evidenceReference":"G28-D3-Q02"},{"questionId":"D3-Q03","questionCode":"D3-Q03","domainCode":"D3","prompt":"Supplier onboarding includes checks on business information, ownership, banking details or other fraud-risk indicators.","controlObjective":"Prevent fictitious, conflicted or misrepresented suppliers from entering the approved vendor population.","weight":1.5,"isCritical":true,"isHardGate":true,"sortOrder":17,"applicabili